menu "LED Blink Configuration"

config BLINK_GPIO
    int "LED GPIO number"
    range 0 33
    default 2
    help
        GPIO number the LED is connected to.
        Many ESP32 dev boards have an on-board LED on GPIO 2.

config BLINK_PERIOD_MS
    int "Blink period (ms)"
    range 10 10000
    default 500
    help
        Time in milliseconds the LED stays on, and then off.

endmenu
